use) that the GPL does not allow a distributor to add. Without this permission,
publishing an Orbit build through those stores would conflict with the GPL.
With it, the conflict is resolved: the store distribution is permitted, and the
source code obligation — the part that keeps Orbit free software — is unchanged.
